Prior art / acknowledgements

This action is an independent, clean-room reimplementation inspired by the
behaviour of HashiCorp's "terraform-cdk-action"
(https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-cdk-action), which is distributed under
the Mozilla Public License 2.0 and was archived on 2025-12-10. No source code
from that project was copied into this repository; the implementation here was
written from a behavioural description of the original action. We gratefully
acknowledge that prior work.

This action runs CDK Terrain's "cdktn-cli" (or, for migration, the legacy
"cdktf-cli") and drives a provisioning engine — OpenTofu ("tofu") by default, or
HashiCorp Terraform ("terraform"). Those CLIs and engines are separate programs
distributed under their own licenses and are not bundled with or redistributed
by this project.
